{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝の話なんだけどね、\n電車で隣の人と\n鼻をすするタイミングが\n一緒になったときの\n地味な恥ずかしさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、わかる人いるよね？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の中ではこう会話してるんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「花粉症ですか？大丈夫ですか？」\n「そっちこそ(ｃ)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"データフォルダー漁ってたら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←こいつでてきて\nどうしても使いたかっただけなんでしょ！\nって指摘は受け付けておりません。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前記事と前前前記事と前前前前記事\nの写メは同じ時に撮った？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nよくおわかりで！\nってけっこうみんな気づいてた？(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レイクタウン行ったことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n100回以上はありますね(￣∇￣)\n...はい、盛りましたが、\nまじで50くらいは行ってます！\nおっきいからなんでも売ってるよね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い、きれい、かっこいい\nどれ言われたい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n基本ほめられるの苦手なんだ(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個別の宿題！\nネタに困ったら使ってください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂以外で好きなアイドルいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近地味に恥ずかしかったことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は短すぎて宿題どころじゃなかったから\n全握のとき出した宿題も受け付けてるよ！\nってことで\n全握のときの宿題↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までアイドルの握手会行ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オヌヌメのご当地お菓子、お土産は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあ〜\n名古屋はキャラバンぶりだし\nngngも読ランぶりだし\n楽しみだなあ(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、もう一個今日の話ね！\nメンバーの靴がいっぱい並んでて\n自分の靴はこうとして足をいれたら\nなんか違和感して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見たら\nれいかの靴だったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、れいかとうちの靴が似てるねって思って\n並んでみたんだが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左:れいか　　　右:中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0663666/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒールの高さ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんたる敗北感...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}